<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ANTWERP, Belgium 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $1</p>
<p>million European Community tennis championship on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Dennis van Scheppingen</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Add first round</p>
<p>2-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Adrian Voinea (Romania) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Francisco Clavet (Spain) beat 3-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 4-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-3</p>
<p>Add first round</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat Guy Forget (France) 6-4 5-7 6-4</p>
<p>(ends first round)</p>
<p>Add second round</p>
<p>Marc Goellner (Germany) beat Christophe Van Garsse (Belgium)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
